          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What certifications and standards should buyers ask about?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Buyers should ask how a provider handles downstream processing, data-bearing equipment, chain-of-custody records, and reporting. Relevant discussions may include NIST 800-88, HIPAA safeguards, ISO 27001 controls, SOC 2 documentation, or DoD 5220.22-M requirements, depending on the organization and equipment. The appropriate controls depend on data type, policy, equipment condition, and the organization's documented procedures."
