            "text": "Organizations searching for electronics recycling near me throughout Bakersfield find STS provides scheduled pickup in Oildale, Rosedale, and all Kern County locations. Our secure fleet serves Bakersfield with scheduled pickups near Highway 99 and throughout the Westside Parkway commercial corridor."
